# ArticleResourceDownload

A mid-article CTA for a PDF, template, or guide. Place it after readers understand the resource’s value. Use the site’s card and primary-link styles; add a gradient only if the site already uses one.

**Semantic hints:** `resource-cta`, `download-cta`, `pdf-cta`, `guide-cta`, `lead-magnet`, `gated-content`, `resource-download`

## Content inputs

Static HTML has no runtime props or imports. Copy the markup and set these values when authoring each instance.

| Input | Type | Default | HTML usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| `topic` | string | Required | Fill in the topic in the default heading. |
| `title` | string | `{topic} Checklist & Notes` | Override the `<h3>` text. |
| `description` | string | “Use this checklist to plan your next steps and capture notes.” | Set the paragraph text. |
| `buttonLabel` | string | `Download Checklist (PDF)` | Set the link text; match the file type. |
| `buttonHref` | string | `#` | Set `href`; replace the placeholder before publishing. |
| `eyebrow` | string | `Free download` | Set the label above the heading. |
| `className` | string | — | Append classes to the section’s `class` attribute. |
| `previewImages` | string[] | — | Replace the decorative sheets with `<img src="…" alt="">` elements, or omit the stack. |

## Standalone example

Save as `.html`. The example downloads a text checklist without external files. For production, point the link at your resource. Keep the previews decorative, retain a visible focus ring, and use a unique heading ID per instance.

```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Resource download</title>
<style>
.resource-cta {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr; align-items:center;
  gap:2rem; padding:2rem; border:1px solid #c7d2fe;
  border-radius:1rem; background:#eef2ff; color:#172554;
  font:1rem/1.5 system-ui;
}
.eyebrow {color:#3730a3;font-weight:700}
.resource-cta h3 {font-size:1.6rem;margin:.25rem 0}
.download {display:inline-block;padding:.65rem 1rem;border-radius:.5rem;
  background:#3730a3;color:white;font-weight:700}
.download:hover {background:#282370}
.download:focus-visible {outline:3px solid #172554;outline-offset:3px}
.previews {display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:1rem}
.sheet {width:5rem;height:7rem;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(white 0 12px,#dbeafe 12px 13px);
  box-shadow:0 4px 10px #17255433;transform:rotate(-3deg)}
.sheet + .sheet {margin: .5rem 0 0 -2rem;transform:rotate(3deg)}
.previews:hover .sheet {transform:rotate(0) scale(1.04)}
@media(max-width:38rem){.resource-cta {grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
<section class="resource-cta" aria-labelledby="resource-title">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Free download</span>
    <h3 id="resource-title">Project Checklist &amp; Notes</h3>
    <p>Plan your next steps and capture notes.</p>
    <a class="download" href="data:text/plain,Checklist%0A-%20Set%20a%20goal"
       download="checklist.txt">Download Checklist (TXT)</a>
  </div>
  <div class="previews" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="sheet"></div><div class="sheet"></div>
  </div>
</section>
```

